/E (I am writing to apply for the position of Junior Web and Database Developer at Mindanao TechBridge Solutions, Inc. I am a fourth-year Bachelor of Science in Information Technology student at the Southern Philippines Agri-Business, Marine and Aquatic School of Technology \(SPAMAST\), and I would like to contribute my web development and database skills to your team.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
457 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 696 0 R
/E (For my individual thesis project, the Library Management System with Analytics, I designed the database, built analytics from borrowing history records, and wrote the complete documentation. This project taught me how to plan, build, and document a system on my own. I have also completed a SoloLearn Java course and Microsoft Office training, and I attended an Intellectual Property orientation.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
