/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 718 0 R
/E (My response is polite and respectful even though the instructions were unclear. It names exactly what information is missing instead of blaming my supervisor. The specific questions allow my supervisor to answer quickly, even from a busy meeting. It also shows initiative by explaining what I will do while waiting, which protects the deadline. Asking before acting prevents mistakes, wasted time, and changes the client should never see.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [13]
>>
